    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Umugabane w'Abalewi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko abatware b'amazu y'Abalewi basanga umutambyi Eleyazari, na Yosuwa mwene Nuni n'abatware b'amazu y'imiryango y'Abisirayeli, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.35.1+NUM.35.2+NUM.35.3+NUM.35.4+NUM.35.5+NUM.35.6+NUM.35.7+NUM.35.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kub 35.1-8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " bababwirira aho bari bari i Shilo mu gihugu cy'i Kanāni bati “Uwiteka yategekesheje Mose yuko tuzahabwa imidugudu yo guturamo, hamwe n'ibikingi byayo ngo tuzajye turagiramo amatungo yacu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko Abisirayeli baha Abalewi iyi midugudu hamwe n'ibikingi byayo hagati muri gakondo yabo, nk'uko Uwiteka yategetse.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ubufindo bwerekana imigabane y'amazu y'Abakohati bene Aroni umutambyi bo mu Balewi, bahabwa imidugudu cumi n'itatu ku y'umuryango wa Yuda, no ku y'uwa Simiyoni, no ku y'uwa Benyamini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi bene Kohati bandi bafindirwa imidugudu cumi ku y'umuryango wa Efurayimu, no ku midugudu y'uwa Dani no ku y'igice cy'umuryango wa Manase.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi bene Gerushoni bafindirwa imidugudu cumi n'itatu ku y'amazu y'umuryango wa Isakari, no ku y'uwa Asheri, no ku y'uwa Nafutali, no ku y'igice cy'umuryango wa Manase i Bashani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi bene Merari nk'uko amazu yabo ari, bahabwa imidugudu cumi n'ibiri ku y'umuryango wa Rubeni, no ku y'uwa Gadi, no ku y'uwa Zebuluni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko rero Abisirayeli bagabanyiriza Abalewi batya iyi midugudu n'ibikingi byayo, nk'uko Uwiteka yategekesheje Mose.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bagabanya mu muryango w'Abayuda no mu muryango w'Abasimeyoni iyi midugudu, bayisobanura amazina. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iyo ni yo ya bene Aroni bo mu mazu ya Kohati b'Abalewi, kuko umugabane wa mbere wari uwabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko babaha i Kiriyataruba (ari yo Heburoni) mu gihugu cy'imisozi ya Yuda hamwe n'ibikingi biyikikije. Aruba uwo yari se wa Anaki, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ariko imirima y'uwo mudugudu n'ibirorero byawo babiha Kalebu mwene Yefune kuba gakondo ye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi baha bene Aroni umutambyi i Heburoni n'ibikingi byaho, ari wo mudugudu w'ubuhungiro bwa gatozi, n'i Libuna n'ibikingi byaho, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "n'i Yatiri n'ibikingi byaho, na Eshitemowa n'ibikingi byaho, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "n'i Holoni n'ibikingi byaho, n'i Debira n'ibikingi byaho, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na Ayini n'ibikingi byaho, n'i Yuta n'ibikingi byaho, n'i Betishemeshi n'ibikingi byaho. Yose ni imidugudu icyenda yo muri iyo miryango ibiri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi mu muryango wa Benyamini babaha i Gibeyoni n'ibikingi byaho, n'i Geba n'ibikingi byaho, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na Anatoti n'ibikingi byaho, na Alumoni n'ibikingi byaho. Yose ni imidugudu ine. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Imidugudu yose ya bene Aroni b'abatambyi yari cumi n'itatu n'ibikingi byayo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi ab'amazu ya bene Kohati b'Abalewi, ari bo bene Kohati bandi, bo bahawe imidugudu y'umugabane wabo mu muryango wa Efurayimu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Babaha i Shekemu n'ibikingi byaho mu gihugu cy'imisozi ya Efurayimu, ari wo mudugudu w'ubuhungiro bwa gatozi, n'i Gezeri n'ibikingi byaho, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "n'i Kibuzayimu n'ibikingi byaho, n'i Betihoroni n'ibikingi byaho. Yose ni imidugudu ine. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi mu muryango wa Dani babaha Eliteke n'ibikingi byaho, n'i Gibetoni n'ibikingi byaho, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na Ayaloni n'ibikingi byaho, n'i Gatirimoni n'ibikingi byaho. Yose ni imidugudu ine. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi mu gice cy'umuryango wa Manase babaha i Tānaki n'ibikingi byaho, n'i Gatirimoni n'ibikingi byaho. Iyo midugudu uko ari ibiri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Imidugudu yose ya bene Kohati bandi yari icumi n'ibikingi byayo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
