          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi mu muryango wa Zebuluni ni ho bahaye ab'amazu ya bene Merari, ari bo Balewi bandi, i Yokineyamu n'ibikingi byaho, n'i Karita n'ibikingi byaho, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "n'i Dimuna n'ibikingi byaho, n'i Nahalali n'ibikingi byaho. Yose ni imidugudu ine. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi mu muryango wa Rubeni babaha i Beseri n'ibikingi byaho, n'i Yahasi n'ibikingi byaho, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "n'i Kedemoti n'ibikingi byaho, n'i Mefāti n'ibikingi byaho. Yose ni imidugudu ine. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi mu muryango wa Gadi babaha i Ramoti y'i Galeyadi n'ibikingi byaho, ari wo mudugudu w'ubuhungiro bwa gatozi, n'i Mahanayimu n'ibikingi byaho, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "n'i Heshiboni n'ibikingi byaho, n'i Yazeri n'ibikingi byaho. Yose ni imidugudu ine. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iyo yose ni yo midugudu ya bene Merari nk'uko amazu yabo ari, ari bo b'ayandi mazu y'Abalewi. Umugabane wabo wari imidugudu cumi n'ibiri.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.40"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Imidugudu yose y'Abalewi yo hagati muri gakondo y'Abisirayeli, yari mirongo ine n'umunani n'ibikingi byayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi iyi midugudu yose yari ikikijwe n'ibikingi byayo. Uko ni ko yari iri yose.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.42"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uko ni ko Uwiteka yahaye Abisirayeli igihugu cyose yasezeranyije ba sekuruza babo, baragihindūra baturayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uwiteka abaha ihumure impande zose nk'uko yasezeranyije ba sekuruza babo. Nta muntu n'umwe wo mu babisha babo bose wabahagaraye imbere, ahubwo Uwiteka abagabiza ababisha babo bose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nta jambo ryiza na rimwe mu yo Uwiteka yasezeranyije ubwoko bw'Abisirayeli ryakūtse, ahubwo byose byarasohoye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.45"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
